1 Download the iso https://fastly.mirror.pkgbuild.com/iso/2026.09.01/
2 Flash the USB Or similar using Rufus Or Similar
3 When on Archiso type pacman -Sy archinstall;archinstall
  For Bootloader Change Systemd-boot to GRUB
  For Kernels Change linux to linux-lts
  For applications Enable Bluetooth enabled audio pipewire print service enabled power management power-profiles-daemon
  Network Configuration Network Manager default backend (or iwd backend if you need it)
  Dont Select Profile because install minimal first!
  After this Install then yes
  Wait until installation completed
4 After install login as root first then run pacman -Syu then pacman -S nano then nano /etc/pacman.conf then uncomment the # on multilib then ctrl x y enter then pacman -Syu
5 Run pacman -S links then run links https://github.com/syslacklinux/Forsaken-Linux then save the Screenshot From 2026-09-26 20-58-37 Then save then change the name 659432023-e7572573-9fac-4254-8789-8767b3009b7d.png to forsaken-logo.png
6 Run mv /root/forsaken-logo.png /usr/share/pixmaps
  Run cp /usr/share/pixmaps/forsaken-logo.png /usr/share/pixmaps/archlinux-logo.png
  Run cp /usr/share/pixmaps/forsaken-logo.png /usr/share/pixmaps/archlinux-logo.svg
  Run cp /usr/share/pixmaps/forsaken-logo.png /usr/share/pixmaps/archlinux-logo-text.svg
  Run cp /usr/share/pixmaps/forsaken-logo.png /usr/share/pixmaps/archlinux-logo-text-dark.svg
7 Run rm /etc/os-release /etc/issue
8 Create forsaken linux customized static files
  Run sudo nano /etc/os-release
  Add this

NAME="Forsaken Linux"
PRETTY_NAME="Forsaken Linux"
ID=forsaken
BUILD_ID=3 (at the speed of light)
HOME_URL="https://github.com/syslacklinux/Forsaken-Linux"
DOCUMENTATION_URL="https://github.com/syslacklinux/Forsaken-Linux/wiki"
SUPPORT_URL="https://github.com/syslacklinux/Forsaken-Linux/discussions/1"
BUG_REPORT_URL="https://github.com/syslacklinux/Forsaken-Linux/issues"
LOGO=/usr/share/pixmaps/forsaken-logo.png

CTRL X Y Enter After Adding this

Run nano /etc/issue
Then add this

Welcome to \s \r \m (\l)

When done CTRL X Y Enter 

Mask the tmpfiles.d mechanism for /etc entries. Copy the default layout to /etc/tmpfiles.d/etc.conf so it overrides the system defaults

cp /usr/lib/tmpfiles.d/etc.conf /etc/tmpfiles.d/etc.conf

Run pacman -S lsb-release
Run nano /etc/lsb-release

Change

DISTRIB_ID="Arch"
DISTRIB_RELEASE="rolling"
DISTRIB_DESCRIPTION="Arch Linux"

To

DISTRIB_ID="Forsaken Linux"
DISTRIB_RELEASE="3 (at the speed of light)"
DISTRIB_DESCRIPTION="Forsaken Linux"

After Done run CTRL X Y Enter

run nano /etc/pacman.conf

Then add on NoExtract
Remove The # Then add this NoExtract = etc/os-release etc/lsb-release etc/issue

FOR LEGACY BIOS AND UEFI Run nano /etc/default/grub

Change GRUB_DISTRIBUTOR="Arch" To GRUB_DISTRIBUTOR="Forsaken" change GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT="loglevel=3 quiet" to GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT=""

After This Run ctrl x y enter

Then run grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg

DONE FOR LEGACY BIOS GRUB CONFIGURING NOW REBOOT

If you are on UEFI

To Complete it

run nano /usr/share/systemd/bootctl/arch.conf
change
title  Arch Linux
To
title  Forsaken Linux

After this run ctrl x y enter
Then cp /usr/share/pixmaps/forsaken-logo.png /usr/share/systemd/bootctl/splash-arch.bmp

Recompile the UKI File mkinitcpio -P

Reboot
